                <pb facs="0243" n="135" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg135"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Rio
                                de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-02-26"><hi rendition="#italic">February 26, 1894</hi></date>.
                        (Received February 26.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Thompson reports an extension of the state of siege to February 28 and the
                    rumored taking of Lapa by the insurgents.</p>
            </div>
